  (null, 'win-clients', 'Client Closing: Handle Objections, Close & Follow Up', 'Response vault', 'new', null, 'not_started', 'both', null, null, '20 Oct: re-record from Jack''s course as one deck-led video per topic. Plays in Classroom and in the Script popup. Drop the pushy bits. In the planned order from Jack''s course, no lesson today.', 60),
